{"id":"n58168-1-10","stage":1,"title":"태권도 · 跆拳道","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58168-1-10-1","ko":"엄마, 저 학교 대표로 태권도 시합에 나가게 됐어요.","zh":"妈妈，我被选为学校代表，要去参加跆拳道比赛了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈。","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}},{"text":"대표로","meaning":"代表","explanation":"대표：代表；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"대표","audio":"/audio/ddae8811c0aada12d04e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66263","senseId":"2","lemma":"대표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대표로","audio":"/audio/075cffdd1799f3f5f463.mp3"}},{"text":"태권도","meaning":"跆拳道","explanation":"태권도：跆拳道。","readings":[{"term":"태권도","audio":"/audio/ac0ebf8b5f4092b0348b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58168","senseId":"1","lemma":"태권도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"태권도","audio":"/audio/ac0ebf8b5f4092b0348b.mp3"}},{"text":"시합에","meaning":"比赛","explanation":"시합：比赛；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"시합","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"13985","senseId":"1","lemma":"시합","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시합에","audio":"/audio/bc8b422f04892ec01a57.mp3"}},{"text":"나가게","meaning":"参加，出战","explanation":"나가다：参加，出战；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"나가다","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71456","senseId":"9","lemma":"나가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나가게","audio":"/audio/9fcff95394d8c48710c7.mp3"}},{"text":"됐어요.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"13","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐어요","audio":"/audio/3b18c9249465f98f5760.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"ddae8811c0aada12","term":"대표","zh":"代表","audio":"/audio/ddae8811c0aada12d04e.mp3","entryId":"66263","definition":"代替某组织、集体等行使权利或承担责任的人。","pronunciation":["대ː표"]},{"id":"ac0ebf8b5f4092b0","term":"태권도","zh":"跆拳道","audio":"/audio/ac0ebf8b5f4092b0348b.mp3","entryId":"58168","definition":"从韩国传统武术中演化而来的，用手和脚实施踢、击、挡等技术而进行攻防的运动。","pronunciation":["태꿘도"]},{"id":"944bf12d99b921ad","term":"시합","zh":"比赛","audio":"/audio/944bf12d99b921ad200e.mp3","entryId":"13985","definition":"体育比赛等互相发挥实力决胜负。","pronunciation":["시합"]},{"id":"961ee88770fe6ab5","term":"나가다","zh":"参加，出战","audio":"/audio/961ee88770fe6ab5a409.mp3","entryId":"71456","definition":"出席聚会，加入竞技比赛，或以候补身份加入选举。","pronunciation":["나가다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/50cb08287c2dd8f4caba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58168-1-10-2","ko":"잘됐구나. 연습을 열심히 해야겠다.","zh":"那太好了。可得努力练习哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘됐구나.","meaning":"好，顺利","explanation":"잘되다：好，顺利；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘됐구나","audio":"/audio/8d75ae07352ac16120d1.mp3"}},{"text":"연습을","meaning":"练习","explanation":"연습：练习；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연습","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92041","senseId":"1","lemma":"연습","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연습을","audio":"/audio/44175398eb3e8a18fd9e.mp3"}},{"text":"열심히","meaning":"认真地","explanation":"열심히：认真地。","readings":[{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67512","senseId":"1","lemma":"열심히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"열심히","audio":"/audio/5be015e332c130d89835.mp3"}},{"text":"해야겠다.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야겠다","audio":"/audio/85b0f5626748f3e821af.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"好，顺利","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"某事情或现象的结果好。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"3906aa577b062703","term":"연습","zh":"练习","audio":"/audio/3906aa577b0627036d72.mp3","entryId":"92041","definition":"为干好某事反复做到熟练。","pronun